Super Users Mada Center has worked to build the capacities of relevant stakeholders through the launch of the capacity building program for Super Users. This program provided extensive training on the basics of Assistive Technology (AT) and its multiple uses in support of persons with disabilities in the areas of independent living, education, health and employment. Ministry of Education and Higher Education Ms. Abeer Saed Alnaimi Special Education Coordinator Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: a.alnaimi2510@education.qa Mr. Alaa Abd Elsattar Sayed Ali Special Education Coordinator Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: a.ali1509@education.qa Ms. Amal Mohammed Aljurf Development Specialist Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: a.aljurf@edu.gov.qa Dr. Mona Sabah Al Kuwari Director of The Visions Center for Evaluation, Consulting and Support Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: mu.alkuwari@edu.gov.qa Ms. Noora Mohsen Saleh Alyafei Training and development specialist Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: noo.alyafei@edu.gov.qa Ms. Wadad Hassan AbdulKarim Abdullah Al-Mir Special Education Coordinator Ministry of Education and Higher Education Email: w.al-meer1803@education.qa Hamad Medical Cooperation Ms. Arwa Saeed Mansour Nasser Occupational Therapist Hamad Medical Cooperation Email: ANaser@hamad.qa Mr. Jose Vero O. Marfil Occupational Therapist Hamad Medical Cooperation Email: JMarfil@hamad.qa Mr. Mamoun M. AL Khoub Occupational Therapy Specialist Hamad Medical Cooperation Email: malkhoub@hamad.qa Shafallah Ms. Hamian Saleh Al-Naimi Educational Guide Shafallah Email: Hamian.Alnaimi@SHAFALLAH.ORG.QA Mr. Mohamed Ibrahim Abdalla Fagier IT Specialist Shafallah Email: mohamed.fagier@SHAFALLAH.ORG.QA Sidra Medical and Research Center Ms. Busi Tshabalala Speech Pathologist Sidra Medical and Research Center Email: btshabalal@sidra.org Qatar Foundation Mr. Bassam Hamad Occupational Therapist Qatar Foundation Email